{"id":"en_they-wanted-a-pawn-got-a-queen","title":"They Wanted a Pawn, Got a Queen","titleEn":"They Wanted a Pawn, Got a Queen","description":"Abandoned as a child and left to survive on her own, Linsey is brought back home eighteen years later by the father who discarded her. His motive is far from sentimental: he wants her to marry Frederick, the crippled CEO of the Fu Group, taking the place of her stepsister. Her father assumes he can still bend the daughter he once cast aside to his will, unaware that the girl he pitied has become a dangerous figure with numerous concealed identities. What he has welcomed back is not a pawn but a debt collector he never anticipated.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/they-wanted-a-pawn-got-a-queen/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/they-wanted-a-pawn-got-a-queen/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Contract Marriage","Expose & Defeat","Unmask the Snob","Mafia Heiress","Contract Lovers","Counterattack"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvq2m/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_they-wanted-a-pawn-got-a-queen_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvq2m/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_they-wanted-a-pawn-got-a-queen_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvq2m/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_they-wanted-a-pawn-got-a-queen_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvq2m/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_they-wanted-a-pawn-got-a-queen_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"